# AI Assistant Guidelines

## 1. Context & Architecture
Before starting ANY backend task, you MUST read the following files to understand the project architecture, data models, and conventions:
* `.claude/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`
* `.claude/reference.md`

## 2. Workflows & Skills
When executing tasks, you must strictly follow our standardized runbooks:
* **Adding an API Endpoint:** Read and follow `.claude/skills/create-api-endpoint.md`. Pay special attention to the bounded-search 200 OK semantic rules and the `docs/MODEL_ASSETS.md` checklist.
* **Verifying Backend Changes:** Read and follow `.claude/skills/verify-backend.md`. You must run the appropriate migration checks, test suites, and DuckDB log-schema checks before completing a task.